fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstmemory.html#GstMapFlags","fragment":"\n\tGstMapFlags\n\nMembers\n\n\tGst.MapFlags\n\nMembers\n\n\tGst.MapFlags\n\nMembers\nFlags used when mapping memory\nmap for read access\nmap for write access\nTake another reference of the memory and store it in the GstMapInfo. This\nmakes sure that the memory stays valid  while it is mapped and\nautomatically unrefs it on unmap.\nfirst flag that can be used for custom purposes\nFlags used when mapping memory\nmap for read access\nmap for write access\nTake another reference of the memory and store it in the GstMapInfo. This\nmakes sure that the memory stays valid  while it is mapped and\nautomatically unrefs it on unmap.\nfirst flag that can be used for custom purposes\nFlags used when mapping memory\nmap for read access\nmap for write access\nTake another reference of the memory and store it in the GstMapInfo. This\nmakes sure that the memory stays valid  while it is mapped and\nautomatically unrefs it on unmap.\nfirst flag that can be used for custom purposes\n"});